[en.IDEA_C08_LONG_MARCH]
Long March

[en.IDEA_C08_LONG_MARCH_desc]
The ponies who refuse to submit gather together and march eastward in wave after wave, towards the final base of harmonism.
Every day, ponies arrive at the destination, and every day, ponies die on the road.

[zh.IDEA_C08_LONG_MARCH]
漫漫长路

[zh.IDEA_C08_LONG_MARCH_desc]
不愿臣服的小马们集结在一起，一波又一波向东行进，向最后的谐律据点进行漫漫长征。
每天都有小马抵达终点，每天都有小马在路上死去，我们所能做的，只有为路上的小马们祈祷...
